      "obligation": "Do not invent health or beauty effects, disease treatment promises, guaranteed transformations or expanded claims. Claims tied to visible packaging or government advertising approval require verification of the exact claim and its permitted scope.",
      "severity": "CRITICAL",
      "recommendedDecision": "REVIEW_REQUIRED",
      "contentTypes": [
        "POST",
